# Normalize all tracked text files to LF in the repository.
#
# This tree previously mixed CRLF and LF across build config and source files,
# which silently broke line-based tooling: a scripted patch written against
# "\n" matched nothing in tsdown.client.ts and reported success while changing
# no bytes. Keeping a single convention makes scripted edits (and diffs)
# trustworthy.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary

# Generated build output is not authored text; keep diffs out of review noise.
lib/ -text
